	(text "EMI SHIELDS\nSH1 covers the MCU and clocks. Fit SH3.\nSH2 covers the PMIC and 5 V converter. Fit SH4.\nBoth frames are BMI-S-202-F-20-R.\nBoth removable lids are BMI-S-202-C-20.\nBond frames to GND with a close via fence.\nKeep switching loops short and filter exits.\nLimit enclosed components to 1.8 mm height."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
